msgstr "{ph0}01{ph1} Bloque de tiempo"

#. {ph0}: <span>
#. {ph1}: </span>
#: website/public/showcase/aegis/index.html:502
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/aegis/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}02{ph1} Key + block"
msgstr "{ph0}02{ph1} Clave + bloque"

#. {ph0}: <span>
#. {ph1}: </span>
#: website/public/showcase/aegis/index.html:510
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/aegis/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}03{ph1} Six digits"
msgstr "{ph0}03{ph1} Seis dígitos"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/showcase/aegis/index.html:569
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/aegis/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Time chooses the block.{ph1} Seconds 30 through 59 all give block 1. At"
" 60 seconds, the block becomes 2."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}El tiempo elige el bloque.{ph1} Los segundos del 30 al 59 dan todos el "
"bloque 1. A los 60 segundos, el bloque pasa a ser 2."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/showcase/aegis/index.html:575
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/aegis/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}The key matters too.{ph1} The generator combines the account key with "
"the block. An account with a different key can show a different code at the "
"same time."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}La clave también importa.{ph1} El generador combina la clave de la "
"cuenta con el bloque. Una cuenta con otra clave puede mostrar un código "
"distinto en el mismo instante."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/showcase/aegis/index.html:582
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/aegis/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Keep six digits.{ph1} The remainder after division by 1,000,000 is "
"padded with zeroes when needed, so a code can begin with 0."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Se conservan seis dígitos.{ph1} El resto de dividir entre 1.000.000 se "
"rellena con ceros cuando hace falta, así que un código puede empezar por 0."

