msgid "Run the environment"
msgstr "Ejecuta el entorno"

#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:455
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid "Check what works"
msgstr "Comprueba qué funciona"

#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:231
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid ""
"An agent can practice finding an issue, creating a folder, or editing a "
"record without running the original app. REA builds the tools the agent "
"calls, the local data those tools use, and a basic test that checks the "
"environment starts and responds."
msgstr ""
"Un agente puede practicar cómo encontrar una incidencia, crear una carpeta o"
" editar un registro sin ejecutar la aplicación original. REA crea las "
"herramientas que el agente invoca, los datos locales que usan esas "
"herramientas y una prueba básica que comprueba que el entorno arranca y "
"responde."

#. {ph0}: <span class="flow-label">
#. {ph1}: </span >
#. {ph2}: <span class="flow-node">
#. {ph3}: </span >
#. {ph4}: <span class="flow-note" >
#. {ph5}: </span >
#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:239
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}01 · Record{ph1}{ph2}Use a test app{ph3}{ph4}Capture requests, "
"responses, and the results of changes.{ph5}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}01 · Grabar{ph1}{ph2}Usa una aplicación de prueba{ph3}{ph4}Captura las "
"solicitudes, las respuestas y los resultados de los cambios.{ph5}"

#. {ph0}: <span class="flow-label">
#. {ph1}: </span >
#. {ph2}: <span class="flow-node">
#. {ph3}: </span >
#. {ph4}: <span class="flow-note" >
#. {ph5}: </span >
#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:247
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}02 · Build with REA{ph1}{ph2}Create tools and local "
"state{ph3}{ph4}Export a runnable AgentEnv folder with the recording and a "
"test.{ph5}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}02 · Crear con REA{ph1}{ph2}Crea las herramientas y el estado "
"local{ph3}{ph4}Exporta una carpeta de AgentEnv ejecutable con la grabación y"
" una prueba.{ph5}"

#. {ph0}: <span class="flow-label">
#. {ph1}: </span >
#. {ph2}: <span class="flow-node" >
#. {ph3}: </span >
#. {ph4}: <span class="flow-note" >
#. {ph5}: </span >
#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:255
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}03 · Run with AgentEnv{ph1}{ph2}Give the environment to an "
"agent{ph3}{ph4}Add task goals and reward checks for evaluation or RL "
"training.{ph5}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}03 · Ejecutar con AgentEnv{ph1}{ph2}Entrega el entorno a un "
"agente{ph3}{ph4}Añade objetivos de tarea y comprobaciones de recompensa para"
" la evaluación o el entrenamiento de RL.{ph5}"

#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:265
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid ""
"The recording determines which operations the environment can support. "
"Changes are supported when the recording confirms their effects."
msgstr ""
"La grabación determina qué operaciones puede admitir el entorno. Los cambios"
" se admiten cuando la grabación confirma sus efectos."

#. {ph0}: <a href="../../get-started/">
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:274
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Set up REA with your coding agent{ph1}. To record an app, have a "
"Chrome-family browser and a running test instance where the agent may "
"create, edit, and delete data. REA records the app you provide; you start it"
" and prepare its test data."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Configura REA con tu agente de programación{ph1}. Para grabar una "
"aplicación, necesitas un navegador de la familia Chrome y una instancia de "
"prueba en ejecución en la que el agente pueda crear, editar y eliminar "
"datos. REA graba la aplicación que tú le indiques; tú la inicias y preparas "
"sus datos de prueba."

#. {ph0}: <a href="https://github.com/scaleapi/agentenv-framework#install" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#. {ph2}: <code>0.9.1334</code>
#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:281
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid ""
"To run the exported environment, install the {ph0}AgentEnv framework{ph1} "
"and start Docker. REA's compatibility check uses AgentEnv version {ph2} with"
" Python 3.12."
msgstr ""
"Para ejecutar el entorno exportado, instala el {ph0}framework AgentEnv{ph1} "
"e inicia Docker. La comprobación de compatibilidad de REA usa la versión "
"{ph2} de AgentEnv con Python 3.12."

#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:291
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid "Record and build with your agent"
msgstr "Graba y crea con tu agente"

#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:292
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid ""
"Tell your agent which app and operations to cover. For an app with folders, "
"adapt this example:"
msgstr ""
"Indica a tu agente qué aplicación y qué operaciones debe cubrir. Para una "
"aplicación con carpetas, adapta este ejemplo:"

#. {ph0}: <span class="terminal-dots" aria-hidden="true" >
#. {ph1}: <i>
#. {ph2}: </i>
#. {ph3}: <i>
#. {ph4}: </i>
#. {ph5}: <i>
#. {ph6}: </i>
#. {ph7}: </span >
#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:298
#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:415
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}{ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}{ph6}{ph7}Your coding agent"
msgstr "{ph0}{ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}{ph6}{ph7}Tu agente de programación"

#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:302
#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:347
#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:382
#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:419
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid "Copy"
msgstr "Copiar"

#. {ph0}: <span class="prompt-symbol" aria-hidden="true">
#. {ph1}: </span >
#. {ph2}: <span id="environment-prompt" >
#. {ph3}: <code>http://127.0.0.1:3000</code>
#. {ph4}: <code>APP_PASSWORD</code>
#. {ph5}: <code>/absolute/path/to/chromium</code>
#. {ph6}: <code>/absolute/path/to/my-env</code>
#. {ph7}: </span >
#. {ph8}: <span class="terminal-cursor" aria-hidden="true">
#. {ph9}: </span>
#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:311
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}Use REA to build an AgentEnv environment from my test web "
"app at {ph3}. Cover listing, creating, renaming, and deleting folders. You "
"may create and remove test folders; leave existing data unchanged. Sign in "
"as admin using the password in {ph4}. Use the browser at {ph5} and export to"
" {ph6}, which does not exist yet. Check which operations are supported and "
"report any gaps.{ph7}{ph8}{ph9}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}Usa REA para crear un entorno de AgentEnv a partir de mi "
"aplicación web de prueba en {ph3}. Cubre el listado, la creación, el cambio "
"de nombre y la eliminación de carpetas. Puedes crear y eliminar carpetas de "
"prueba; deja sin cambios los datos existentes. Inicia sesión como admin con "
"la contraseña de {ph4}. Usa el navegador en {ph5} y exporta a {ph6}, que "
"todavía no existe. Comprueba qué operaciones se admiten e informa de "
"cualquier carencia.{ph7}{ph8}{ph9}"

#. {ph0}: <code>APP_PASSWORD</code>
#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:326
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid ""
"Example prompt. Replace the URL, operations, account, and paths. Set {ph0} "
"in the environment that starts REA's MCP server so the password stays out of"
" the prompt."
msgstr ""
"Prompt de ejemplo. Sustituye la URL, las operaciones, la cuenta y las rutas."
" Define {ph0} en el entorno que inicia el servidor MCP de REA para que la "
"contraseña no aparezca en el prompt."

#. {ph0}: <a href="#run">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:331
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid ""
"Your agent inspects the app, records a session, checks the supported "
"operations, and exports the environment. After export, continue with "
"{ph0}running the environment{ph1}."
msgstr ""
"Tu agente inspecciona la aplicación, graba una sesión, comprueba las "
"operaciones admitidas y exporta el entorno. Tras la exportación, continúa "
"con {ph0}la ejecución del entorno{ph1}."

#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:338
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid "Or use a saved recording"
msgstr "O usa una grabación guardada"

#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:339
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid ""
"A HAR file records a browser's network requests and responses. Export one "
"with API response bodies from the browser's network panel, then build into a"
" new or empty folder:"
msgstr ""
"Un archivo HAR registra las solicitudes y respuestas de red de un navegador."
" Exporta uno que incluya los cuerpos de las respuestas de la API desde el "
"panel de red del navegador y, después, crea el entorno en una carpeta nueva "
"o vacía:"

#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:346
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid "Build the environment"
msgstr "Crear el entorno"

#. {ph0}: <code>capture-browser-scenario</code>
#. {ph1}: <code>--dry-run</code>
#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:358
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid ""
"You can also pass capture Evidence JSON saved by REA's {ph0} or HAR "
"inspection. Evidence is the saved recording with its source information. The"
" build reads local data and writes the folder without contacting the app. "
"Add {ph1} to review the report without writing files."
msgstr ""
"También puedes pasar el JSON de Evidence de captura guardado por {ph0} de "
"REA o por la inspección de HAR. Evidence es la grabación guardada junto con "
"la información de su origen. La creación lee datos locales y escribe la "
"carpeta sin contactar con la aplicación. Añade {ph1} para revisar el informe"
" sin escribir archivos."

#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:366
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid ""
"The report lists read operations, supported changes, and operations withheld"
" because the recording did not establish their effects. Each withheld "
"operation has a reason and a hint about what to record next."
msgstr ""
"El informe enumera las operaciones de lectura, los cambios admitidos y las "
"operaciones excluidas porque la grabación no estableció sus efectos. Cada "
"operación excluida indica un motivo y una pista sobre qué grabar a "
"continuación."

#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:375
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid ""
"Whether your agent exported the folder or you built it from a recording, run"
" it with AgentEnv:"
msgstr ""
"Tanto si tu agente exportó la carpeta como si la creaste tú a partir de una "
"grabación, ejecútala con AgentEnv:"

#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:381
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid "Run the environment test"
msgstr "Ejecutar la prueba del entorno"

#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:393
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid ""
"Use the path your agent reported if it differs. The first run builds the "
"container image and needs access to its image and package sources."
msgstr ""
"Usa la ruta que indicó tu agente si es distinta. La primera ejecución "
"construye la imagen del contenedor y necesita acceso a los orígenes de su "
"imagen y de sus paquetes."

#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:398
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid ""
"The included smoke task is a basic test. It checks the tool count and, when "
"a suitable read tool exists, calls it and checks its response status. "
"Passing it shows the environment starts and responds in that setup."
msgstr ""
"La tarea smoke incluida es una prueba básica. Comprueba el número de "
"herramientas y, cuando existe una herramienta de lectura adecuada, la invoca"
" y comprueba el estado de su respuesta. Superarla demuestra que el entorno "
"arranca y responde en esa configuración."

#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:406
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid "Add tasks and reward checks"
msgstr "Añade tareas y comprobaciones de recompensa"

#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:407
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid ""
"Use the environment with your RL framework to define goals, score results, "
"and run training. Your coding agent can help write the tasks and checks. "
"Start with one operation the environment supports:"
msgstr ""
"Usa el entorno con tu framework de RL para definir objetivos, puntuar "
"resultados y ejecutar el entrenamiento. Tu agente de programación puede "
"ayudarte a escribir las tareas y las comprobaciones. Empieza por una "
"operación que el entorno admita:"

#. {ph0}: <span class="prompt-symbol" aria-hidden="true">
#. {ph1}: </span >
#. {ph2}: <span id="environment-task" >
#. {ph3}: </span >
#. {ph4}: <span class="terminal-cursor" aria-hidden="true">
#. {ph5}: </span>
#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:428
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}Use this exported environment to add an AgentEnv task that "
"asks an agent to create a folder named Practice. Check the environment state"
" to confirm the folder exists with that name, and use that check to score "
"the result. Reset the environment before each run. Use the AgentEnv task and"
" verifier formats.{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}Usa este entorno exportado para añadir una tarea de AgentEnv"
" que pida a un agente crear una carpeta llamada Practice. Comprueba el "
"estado del entorno para confirmar que la carpeta existe con ese nombre y usa"
" esa comprobación para puntuar el resultado. Restablece el entorno antes de "
"cada ejecución. Usa los formatos de tarea y de verificador de "
"AgentEnv.{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}"

#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:440
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid ""
"Example prompt for an environment that supports folder creation. A task that"
" changes data should check the resulting state; a retrieval task can check "
"an answer against a recorded value."
msgstr ""
"Prompt de ejemplo para un entorno que admite la creación de carpetas. Una "
"tarea que cambia datos debe comprobar el estado resultante; una tarea de "
"consulta puede contrastar una respuesta con un valor grabado."

#. {ph0}: <a href="https://www.agentenvframework.com/docs" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:445
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid ""
"The export includes the runnable environment and its basic test. Task-"
"specific grading is added in the evaluation workflow. See the {ph0}AgentEnv "
"documentation{ph1} for tasks, verifiers, and agent connections."
msgstr ""
"La exportación incluye el entorno ejecutable y su prueba básica. La "
"calificación específica de cada tarea se añade en el flujo de evaluación. "
"Consulta la {ph0}documentación de AgentEnv{ph1} para conocer las tareas, los"
" verificadores y las conexiones de agentes."

#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:456
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid ""
"For changes to be supported, record the results as well as the action: read "
"an item, change it, then read the item and its list again before the next "
"change. Repeat with different values. For deletes, record the missing-item "
"response and the updated list."
msgstr ""
"Para que los cambios se admitan, graba los resultados además de la acción: "
"lee un elemento, cámbialo y vuelve a leer el elemento y su lista antes del "
"siguiente cambio. Repite con valores distintos. Para las eliminaciones, "
"graba la respuesta de elemento inexistente y la lista actualizada."

#. {ph0}: <code>environment-compare</code>
#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:462
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid ""
"A passing startup test, an agent completing a task, and matching the "
"original app are separate checks. For the last one, use {ph0} with a "
"separate recording of calls made against the app from the same starting "
"data."
msgstr ""
"Superar la prueba de arranque, que un agente complete una tarea y coincidir "
"con la aplicación original son comprobaciones distintas. Para la última, usa"
" {ph0} con una grabación aparte de las llamadas hechas a la aplicación desde"
" los mismos datos iniciales."

#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:468
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid ""
"Before sharing the folder, review its retained response bodies and local "
"paths. Custom headers, query values, and body tokens can remain. Credential-"
"name warnings identify places to review; they do not remove those values."
msgstr ""
"Antes de compartir la carpeta, revisa los cuerpos de respuesta y las rutas "
"locales que conserva. Pueden quedar cabeceras personalizadas, valores de "
"consulta y tokens en los cuerpos. Los avisos de nombres de credenciales "
"señalan lugares que revisar; no eliminan esos valores."

#. {ph0}: <a href="https://github.com/morluto/rea/blob/main/docs/agent-
#. environments-quickstart.md" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#. {ph2}: <a href="https://github.com/morluto/rea/blob/main/docs/agent-
#. environments.md" >
#. {ph3}: </a >
#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:474
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid ""
"Follow the {ph0}full recording and validation guide{ph1} for coverage "
"reports and comparison commands. The {ph2}environment reference{ph3} covers "
"direct MCP serving, state controls, and limits."
msgstr ""
"Sigue la {ph0}guía completa de grabación y validación{ph1} para conocer los "
"informes de cobertura y los comandos de comparación. La {ph2}referencia de "
"entornos{ph3} cubre el servicio directo por MCP, los controles de estado y "
"los límites."

#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:6
