msgstr "{ph0}Guía para crear un entorno{ph1} · {ph2}Ver la demo en X{ph3}"

#. {ph0}: <a href="#workflow">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/guides/rl-environments/index.html:219
#, python-brace-format
