#: website/public/index.html:1124
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "With REA set up in your agent, give it a task like this:"
msgstr "Con REA configurado en tu agente, dale una tarea como esta:"

#. {ph0}: <span class="prompt-symbol" aria-hidden="true">
#. {ph1}: </span >
#. {ph2}: <span id="home-environment-prompt" >
#. {ph3}: <code>http://127.0.0.1:3000</code>
#. {ph4}: <code>my-env</code>
#. {ph5}: </span >
#. {ph6}: <span class="terminal-cursor" aria-hidden="true">
#. {ph7}: </span>
#: website/public/index.html:1140
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}Use REA to build an RL environment from my test web app at "
"{ph3}. Cover listing, creating, renaming, and deleting folders. You may "
"create and remove test folders. Leave existing data unchanged. Save it in a "
"folder named {ph4}. Check which operations work and tell me how to run "
"it.{ph5}{ph6}{ph7}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}Usa REA para crear un entorno de RL a partir de mi "
"aplicación web de prueba en {ph3}. Incluye listar, crear, renombrar y borrar"
" carpetas. Puedes crear y borrar carpetas de prueba, pero no modifiques los "
"datos existentes. Guárdalo en una carpeta llamada {ph4}, comprueba qué "
"operaciones funcionan y dime cómo ejecutarlo.{ph5}{ph6}{ph7}"

#: website/public/index.html:1152
msgctxt "page:index.html"
